// Embeds the app icon into leyline-cli.exe (Windows target only), so
// Explorer/taskbar show the Leyline badge instead of the generic console
// .exe icon — mirrors `crates/leyline-studio/windows-manifest.rc`, minus
// the DPI-awareness manifest resource: the CLI has no window to negotiate
// DPI for. Path is relative to this .rc file's own directory
// (crates/leyline-cli/), matching the "../../packaging/..." prefix used
// from `leyline-studio`.
1 ICON "../../packaging/icons/icon.ico"
